  Arabic is the DEFAULT locale, not a translation. Egyptian register: write it
  the way someone would say it out loud, not the way a press release would.
  English lives in values-en/.

  Copy rules for this product:
    * Never imply certainty about a match. "قد يكون" always, never "تم العثور".
    * Never blame the user for a failed search — an empty feed is our problem.
    * FOUND reporters get restrictive coaching; LOST reporters get encouraging
      coaching. They are not the same flow.
-->
